\r\n- [x] #2168\r\n- [x] #2185\r\n\r\n## Notable but not blocking (in no particular order): \r\n- #1851 \r\n- #1844 \r\n- #1858 \r\n- #1860 \r\n- #1892 \r\n- #1891\r\n- #1853 \r\n- #1633 \r\n- #1609\r\n- #925\r\n- #2048\r\n- #2050\r\n\r\n## Issues that can be closed by new release\r\n- #1986 \r\n- #1985\r\n- #1045\r\n\r\nTwo of these issues are about services that are going to be removed, so can't be fixed, and one is a more general\r\ncritique of the router which has been re-written.\r\n\r\n## Misc\r\n\r\nSome extra bits to do before the release:\r\n\r\n- [x] Review dependencies\r\n- [x] Review and list issues that are resolved by the new release (more of a note to self 💭)\r\n- [x] Confirm that each example is working correctly (the CI only checks if they compile) ( Tracking issue #2205 )\r\n- [x] Consider migration information and where it would live - yew.rs? as a discussion? ( PR #2210 )\r\n- [x] Update CHANGELOG ( Open PR #2199 )\r\n- [x] Add the new version and make it default in yew docs (No need to copy all files, just make it so that new version points to same things as \"next\") ( Open PR #2220 )\r\n\r\nExpect all sections to change - I will update it as we go :)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/2052/reactions","total_count":39,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":18,"confused":0,"heart":11,"rocket":0,"eyes":10},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/2052/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5322067054,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBtKdYc47kIl_zwAAAAE9OExu","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/events/5322067054","actor":{"login":"mc1098","id":43726912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzI2OTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43726912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mc1098","html_url":"https://github.com/mc1098","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mc1098/followers","following_